ound Rock San Marcos Other Previous 1 2 3 4 5 Next View Results (124\n    ) Title Department Location Recruitment Type Close Date Review Date Residence Director - Multiple Positions DHRL Administration San Marcos Open Recruiting 09/28/2026 The Residence Director position is a full-time, live-in role with primary responsibility for managing the daily operations of one or more residential buildings. Residence Directors (RD) are responsible for building a strong community, supporting staff through supervision, and generating meaningful opportunities for students to connect to campus through intentional interactions and connections. ... View Details Bookmark Assistant NCAA Certification Officer Athletic Certification San Marcos Open Recruiting The Assistant NCAA Athletics Certification Officer is responsible for assisting the NCAA Athletics Certification Officer in obtaining, evaluating, and documenting the academic credentials in accordance with National Collegiate Athletics Association (NCAA) and conference eligibility rules for approximately 400+ student-athletes. View Details Bookmark Nontenure Faculty Pool - Music School of Music San Marcos 05/31/2027 The School of Music seeks to develop a pool of candidates for possible temporary/non-tenured faculty to teach music courses. New hires will join a nationally recognized department with a dynamic faculty dedicated to a collaborative and innovative approach to teaching undergraduate and graduate students.Temporary/non-tenured faculty are appointed to teach one to four courses per semester. Teachi... View Details Bookmark Graphic Designer VP Student Success San Marcos Open Recruiting 09/18/2026 The Graphic Designer position produces high-quality visual design for print, digital, video, and web to support the Division of Student Success and its programs, services, and initiatives. The role ensures consistent application of university and divisional brand standards across all departments, serving as a key steward of the visual identity and advising departments on effective design practi... View Details Bookmark Digital Media Manager ALERRT Center San Marcos Open Recruiting Create, curate, and publish high-quality, relevant, and engaging content (graphics, videos, photos, articles, and posts) across platforms including Facebook, Twitter/X, Instagram, LinkedIn, and YouTube. View Details Bookmark Accountant I Support Services San Marcos Open Recruiting 09/14/2026 Support Services within the Division of Student Success is seeking a detail-oriented and customer-focused Accountant I to support the financial operations of the University Dining program. This position is responsible for processing, recording, reconciling, auditing, and analyzing financial transactions; preparing financial reports; managing billing activities; monitoring account balances and t... View Details Bookmark Immigration Advisor International Affairs San Marcos Open Recruiting 09/09/2026 The Immigration Advisor, DSO, provides immigration advising and regulatory support to F-1 students on Pre-Completion OPT, Post-Completion OPT, and STEM OPT, ensuring compliance with SEVP and DHS regulations. The role issues OPT/STEM OPT I-20 recommendations, maintains accurate SEVIS records, monitors employment reporting and eligibility requirements, and advises students and employers on work a... View Details Bookmark Education Mobility Outreach Coordinator International Affairs San Marcos Open Recruiting 09/07/2026 The Education Mobility Outreach Coordinator is responsible for providing outreach and recruitment efforts for the three Education Mobility units to increase student enrollment and drive awareness of programs. This position reports directly to the Director of Education Mobility. View Details Bookmark Accountant IV Financial Reporting San Marcos Open Recruiting 10/12/2026 Performs advanced, professional accounting functions that support the integrity of the university’s financial reporting and accounting operations. Responsible for state appropriations, cash and investment accounting activities, including oversight of daily payment processing, reconciliation of financial data between the university’s general ledger and the Uniform Statewide Accounting System (US... View Details Bookmark Air Conditioning Mech I Facilities Operations San Marcos Open Recruiting The University Facilities Management Department is seeking a motivated and dependable entry-level HVAC technician to join our maintenance team. This position assists with the installation, maintenance, troubleshooting, and repair of heating, ventilation, air conditioning, and refrigeration systems across campus buildings. View Details Bookmark Custodian Student Center San Marcos Open Recruiting 09/09/2026 09/10/2026 Responsible for enhancing the physical appearance of the buildings on campus by providing a sanitary environment and preventing the transmission of disease carrying microorganisms. View Details Bookmark Air Conditioning Mechanic II Facilities Operations San Marcos Open Recruiting The University is seeking a skilled and motivated HVAC Technician II to join our Facilities Services team. This mid-level position is responsible for installing, maintaining, troubleshooting, and repairing heating, ventilation, air conditioning, and refrigeration (HVAC/R) systems across academic buildings, laboratories, residence halls, athletic facilities, and administrative spaces. View Details Bookmark Campus Expression & Community Standards Coordinator Health & Wellbeing San Marcos Open Recruiting 09/09/2026 Reporting to the Associate Vice President for Student Success and Dean of Students, the Campus Expression & Community Standards Coordinator provides primary operational coordination for the university’s expressive activity monitoring and response program, including both administrative operations and real-time campus response. The position coordinates expressive activity readiness and respon... View Details Bookmark Social Science Researcher Texas School Safety Center San Marcos Open Recruiting 09/20/2026 The Texas School Safety Center (TxSSC) is an official university-level research center at Texas State University. The TxSSC is tasked in Chapter 37 of the Texas Education Code and the Governor’s Homeland Security Strategic Plan with key school safety initiatives and mandates. The TxSSC serves as the clearinghouse for the dissemination of safety and security information through research, trainin... View Details Bookmark Director, TXST One Stop TXST One Stop San Marcos Open Recruiting The TXST One Stop works with the offices of Admissions, Financial Aid and Scholarships, Student Business Services, and University Registrar to assist students and their families with navigating the admissions, financial aid, and payment processes. View Details Bookmark Senior Network Administrator Network Operations San Marcos Open Recruiting Texas State University is hiring a Sr. Network Administrator to help design, operate, secure, and modernize the university’s multi-campus network infrastructure. This is a senior technical role responsible for supporting enterprise wired, wireless, data center, security, and wide-area network services used across the university.The position works with a broad range of network technologies, incl... View Details Bookmark Academic Advisor I AA-Health Professions San Marcos Open Recruiting 09/09/2026 Responsible for providing quality undergraduate advice to current and prospective students, and serves as a resource for them and their parents. View Details Bookmark Dispatcher UPD Communications/Records San Marcos Open Recruiting The Dispatcher is responsible for receiving and prioritizing incoming calls for assistance from the university and managing and directing responding units. View Details Bookmark Coordinator, Team Operations Football San Marcos Open Recruiting The Coordinator of Team Operations assists the head coach in the organization, management and administration of strategies as they relate to the goals and objectives of the football program. View Details Bookmark Financial Operations Specialist VP for Information Technology San Marcos Open Recruiting The FinOps Specialist performs financial operations and cloud cost management activities in support of the IT Division. This position works collaboratively with IT Finance, IT Procurement, and Central Systems Operations and is responsible for monitoring and analyzing cloud expenditures, usage, budgets, forecasts, billing, and financial performance to promote cost transparency, accountability, a... View Details Bookmark Associate Professor or Professor, Technical Communication English San Marcos 09/21/2026 The Department of English at Texas State University invites applicants for a full-time (nine-month) faculty position at the rank of tenured associate, tenured advanced associate, or tenured full professor to begin in Fall 2027 at our San Marcos campus.The successful candidate will be expected to sustain a significant, ongoing research agenda commensurate with their appointed rank that leads to ... View Details Bookmark Assistant Professor, Technical Communication English San Marcos 09/21/2026 The Department of English at Texas State University invites applicants for a full-time (nine-month) tenure-track faculty position at the rank of assistant professor to begin in Fall 2027 at our San Marcos campus.The successful candidate will be expected to sustain a significant, ongoing research agenda leading to peer-reviewed publication in the field of technical communication. The candidate w... View Details Bookmark Open Rank Tenure Line Faculty in Accounting Department of Accounting San Marcos 09/30/2026 The Department of Accounting in the McCoy College of Business at Texas State invites applications for an Assistant Professor, Associate Professor, or Professor. The position requires the ability to teach undergraduate and graduate accounting courses, conduct research leading to high-quality peer-reviewed publications, and provide service to students, the department, the profession, and the univ... View Details Bookmark Web & Mobile Strategy Manager University Marketing San Marcos Open Recruiting 09/11/2026 09/15/2026 Develop marketing and communications strategy that drives increased awareness and engagement with internal and external audiences. View Details Bookmark Landscape Specialist Facilities Services San Marcos Open Recruiting 09/07/2026 Assist the Director of Grounds in developing and maintaining a high-quality tier 1 landscape by performing quality assurance duties, identifying landscape improvement and renovation needs, assist in designing new beds, and identifying plant replacement needs. Ensure new landscape establishment. View Details Bookmark GIS Technician Center for Archaeological Studies Other - Fort Knox, Kentucky Open Recruiting 09/06/2026 09/07/2026 Texas State University is searching for a GIS Technician who can support the environmental compliance program at Fort Knox, located near Louisville, Kentucky. We are looking for a person who can provide technical guidance to the Government in performing data acquisition and analysis that is accurate, complete, current, and valid for the installation’s environmental layers. This includes coordin... View Details Bookmark Head Custodian DHRL Administration San Marcos Open Recruiting 09/07/2026 09/08/2026 The Head Custodian position provides leadership, coordination, and supervision of custodial operations at Texas State Housing Facilities to ensure a clean and safe environment. The head custodian supervises full-time staff that service student residential facilities. View Details Bookmark Locksmith DHRL Administration San Marcos Open Recruiting 09/07/2026 09/08/2026 The locksmith will perform the work required to maintain, repair, install, and operate doors and locks of the mechanical and electronic variety to ensure the safety and security of the residence halls and apartments managed and operated by the Department of Housing and Residential Life. View Details Bookmark HR Business Partner Human Resources San Marcos Open Recruiting Responsible for aligning business objectives with HR strategies/servicesby serving as a consultant to leadership and employees. Acts as aliaison between supported divisions/departments and HR specialtyfunctions to ensure that HR solutions are aligned with institutionalpriorities. View Details Bookmark PRN Certified Medical Assistant University Health Services San Marcos Open Recruiting Join the Texas State University Student Health Center, a nationally accredited ambulatory health care facility with in-house laboratory and radiology services. Serving more than 40,000 students, our team-oriented organization is committed to providing high-quality, patient-centered care. We are seeking a PRN Medical Assistant to become part of our dedicated clinical team. Clinic operating hours... View Details Bookmark Previous 1 2 3 4 5 Next Office of Human Resources 231 N. Guadalupe St. San Marcos, Texas 78666 Phone: 512.245.2557 Fax: 512.245.1942 Email: hr@txstate.edu Monday through Friday 8 a.m. to 5 p.m. To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
