      "description": "Student Employment\n      \n      : Texas State University Skip to Content Search Home Student Employment Students Supervisors Current Students Faculty & Staff Family & Visitors Alumni Athletics Give Library Round Rock News Student Employment Student Employment Connecting students to part-time employment Student employment at TXST is an exciting collaboration between Career Services, Human Resources, and Financial Aid, designed to unlock incredible opportunities for students! This page is your ultimate guide, packed with essential resources and key contacts, ready to support your student employment needs and help you thrive in your journey. Find Resources Discover important information and resources below! STUDENTS ON-CAMPUS HIRING DEPARTMENTS HANDSHAKE Search jobs, events and more through our comprehensive career services platform, Handshake. Job Search Appointment Scheduling Career Development Job Fairs + Events STUDENT LOGIN DEPT LOGIN Student Recognition Celebrate student employees during National Student Employment Week or get recognized for your hard work and dedication with the Student Employee Recognition Awards. National Student Employment Week Student Employee Recognition Awards 175 HIRING DEPARTMENTS ACROSS CAMPUS 5,000+ STUDENTS EMPLOYED BY TXST EACH YEAR Back to top Student Employment Student Employment For information about this website contact studentjobs@txstate.edu Site Map Facebook Instagram Twitter Resources Resources Human Resources Financial Aid for Departments SAP Custom Link 1 Custom Link 2 Custom Link 3 Custom Link 4 About Texas State Careers Emergency Info Apply Legal Search Terms Start Search Select search scope This Site All Texas State Close Search Dialog Beginning of video dialog content Close Video Previous Video Next Video End of video dialog content"
