ing The Assistant Director for Direct Response is responsible for planning, implementing, and optimizing direct response fundraising campaigns that generate philanthropic support for Texas State University.The Assistant Director supports strategic fundraising communications and donor initiatives that strengthen philanthropic participation across Texas State University. This position develops and ex... View Details Bookmark Plant Mechanic I Facilities Services San Marcos Open Recruiting Responsible for the maintenance of all equipment associated with the production of steam, chilled water, and electricity. View Details Bookmark Sr Psychologist Counseling Center San Marcos Open Recruiting Texas State University Counseling Center strives to provide services and programs within a framework of professional competence, affirmation, and responsiveness to a variety of lived experiences. The staff seeks professional colleagues interested in joining a collaborative and positive team that is committed to providing services to support all students in our culturally and economically varied... View Details Bookmark Police Officer UPD Operations San Marcos Open Recruiting 06/08/2026 Texas State University (TXST) Police Department is looking for lateral transfers who are motivated to help others and be a part of the UPD Team. Every day our officers work with students, faculty, staff and the community to ensure safety for everyone. Here at TXST we are committed to having a workforce that resembles the people of Texas and the University we serve. View Details Bookmark Grant Director- McNair Scholars McNair Scholars San Marcos Open Recruiting 06/15/2026 This is a grant funded position. Continuation of this position is contingent upon grant funding.The Director is responsible for the daily operation and facilitation of the programmatic and administrative components of the McNair Scholars program.The Director will be responsible for coordinating and providing administrative oversight for all phases of the Program.Primary duties involve implement... View Details Bookmark Lieutenant UPD Operations San Marcos Open Recruiting 04/20/2026 Assist the Chief of Police with the administration, management and oversight of the University Police Department including rendering basic police services in an effort to reduce incidences of crime and enforce federal, state and local laws and ordinances. View Details Bookmark Construction Manager I Facilities Planning Design Other - Round Rock, on Occasion, San Marcos Open Recruiting Responsible for planning, designing, estimating, scheduling, directing, and inspecting small-sized renovation and construction projects to ensure objectives are met. View Details Bookmark Temporary Positions - Craft Worker Human Resources Round Rock, San Marcos Open Recruiting What makes Texas State unique is the people who work here. Texas State University seeks candidates whose professional background includes embracing cooperation and ideas, a global perspective, and a commitment to community-building. View Details Bookmark Temporary Positions - Laborer Human Resources Round Rock, San Marcos Open Recruiting What makes Texas State unique is the people who work here. Texas State University seeks candidates whose professional background includes embracing cooperation and ideas,, a global perspective, and a commitment to community-building. View Details Bookmark Temporary Positions - Service Worker Human Resources Round Rock, San Marcos Open Recruiting What makes Texas State unique is the people who work here. Texas State University seeks candidates whose professional background includes embracing cooperation and ideas,, a global perspective, and a commitment to community-building. View Details Bookmark Temporary Positions - Technician Human Resources Round Rock, San Marcos Open Recruiting What makes Texas State unique is the people who work here. Texas State University seeks candidates whose professional background includes embracing cooperation and ideas,, a global perspective, and a commitment to community-building. View Details Bookmark Temporary Positions - Professional Human Resources Round Rock, San Marcos Open Recruiting What makes Texas State unique is the people who work here. Texas State University seeks candidates whose professional background includes embracing a diversity of people and ideas, a spirit of inclusiveness, a global perspective, and a commitment to community-building. View Details Bookmark Temporary Positions - Administrative Support Human Resources Round Rock, San Marcos Open Recruiting What really makes Texas State unique is the people who work here. Texas State University seeks candidates whose professional background includes embracing cooperation and ideas, a global perspective, and a commitment to community-building. View Details Bookmark Construction Manager II Facilities Planning Design Other - Round Rock, on Occasion, San Marcos Open Recruiting Responsible for planning, designing, estimating, scheduling, directing, and inspecting small to intermediate-sized renovation and construction projects to ensure objectives are met. View Details Bookmark Previous 1 2 Next Office of Human Resources 231 N. Guadalupe St. San Marcos, Texas 78666 Phone: 512.245.2557 Fax: 512.245.1942 Email: hr@txstate.edu Monday through Friday 8 a.m. to 5 p.m. To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
